 "notes": "82 flat IEM models cut to 8 archetypes (with old models as versions) and 20 leftovers; dropped SKU duplicates (Elysian Annihilator (2021), ThieAudio Monarch Mk2 prefixed copy) and long-tail Chi-Fi models (TIN HiFi P2/T2 Plus/T3, Softears, Acoustune, etc.) to stay under the mixed-mode cap. Custom IEMs organised by UE / JH Audio / 64 Audio lineages. Earbud icons Sennheiser MX500 and Sony Fontopia/MDR-E888 left out: only forum snippets, no retrievable page. Sennheiser ACCENTUM Open kept in Open-ear earphones (old data listed it under true wireless and earbuds). founding years left blank where no page gave them."
